        <item>
            <title>0.12.3</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 23:40:24 +0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.12.3</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.12.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in 0.12.3</h2>
<ul>
<li>The blur behind the menu is now the clean kind: a deep, colour-true frost (no grey-out, no extra darkening from the system material) with fine film grain instead of speckle. If you never touched the backdrop sliders, yours follow; a hand-tuned veil stays</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
